sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent code
    participant P as pydantic_ai._step / openai _step_async
    participant G as gate_async
    participant C as AsyncioChannel
    participant App as Approver (test / future UI)
    participant Cursor as respond_or_forward

    Note over A,Cursor: Setup: replay(mode=INTERACTIVE, approval=channel). Session active via ContextVar.

    Note over A,Cursor: Stage 1 gate fires before the dispatch decision
    A->>P: await model.request(messages)
    P->>P: build Step(kind=LLM, payload, cursor)
    P->>G: await gate_async(session, step)
    alt no channel OR mode is not INTERACTIVE
        G-->>P: None
        Note right of G: zero-cost no-op — existing 291 tests unaffected
        P->>Cursor: respond_or_forward as today
    else INTERACTIVE + channel attached
        G->>C: await channel.submit(step)
        C->>App: channel.next_step() yields the pending step
        Note right of App: developer inspects messages / model / params
        App->>C: channel.decide(APPROVE)
        C-->>G: Decision(kind=APPROVE)
        G-->>P: Decision(kind=APPROVE)
        Note right of G: mode unchanged — next call pauses again
        P->>Cursor: respond_or_forward(signature)
    end

    Note over A,Cursor: Stage 2 dispatch proceeds exactly as Phase 3
    alt signature matches recorded span at cursor
        Cursor->>Cursor: advance_cursor
        Cursor-->>P: RecordedResponse (cached)
        P-->>A: materialised cached response
        Note right of Cursor: zero outbound HTTP
    else divergence (BRANCH-like behaviour post-approve)
        Cursor-->>P: None (authorise forward)
        P->>P: forward live + capture span
        P-->>A: live response
    end

    Note over A,Cursor: Outcome: call paused, developer approved, dispatch proceeded unchanged from Phase 3.
